        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In May 2008, we entered into a management agreement with Safety Management and in May 2015, we entered into a management agreement with Safe Bulkers Management, pursuant to which our Managers provided us with our executive officers, technical, administrative, commercial and certain other services.",
        "start_character": 30088,
        "end_character": 30386
      },
      {
